the hype behind eldon ring continues to  build as a release date draws near what  spoilers have already made their way  online keep watching if you're hungry  for every morsel of information about  this long-awaited game  during the game's closed network test  players with jailbroken ps4s datamined  old and ring and uncovered some closely  guarded secrets from software clearly  understood the risk of players digging  too deeply into the test run which is  why the developers placed a giant bear  in the game that would kill any players  who managed to find the way outside of  the test boundaries not too surprising  considering the developers enduring  sadistic tendencies but really though  after all the things dark souls players  have been through over the years is a  ferocious bear all that intimidating hey  ron i'm riding a furry tractor  unfortunately for from software the  developers couldn't predict this new ps4  exploit the verge released a report  about the ps4 jailbreak on december 14  2021 and spoilers for eldon ring began  making rounds just a few days later of  course until the game actually releases  from software could certainly make as  many changes as it wants to the leaked  material  the elden rings story trailer introduces  the basics of the game's backstory it  opens by revealing that the fall of the  world's demigods began with godwin the  golden's death newly leaked information  from the game however seems to reveal  that godwin is very much alive the  leagues show that godwin will actually  be the game's primary blacksmith and the  players will rely on his abilities to  upgrade their weapons similar to the  process in dark souls considering that  the game's trailer claimed that godwin  had died after the rune of death was  stolen how does he factor into the rest  of the game's story another audio file  features godwin quietly rambling about  the grail and his ability to smith  weapons the speech is in line with  characters from previous souls games who  lost their minds after taking part in  horrifying events for a very long time  i was trapped within the crystal golem  from my home i was taken  and banished to a plane of distortion  perhaps tragedy left godwin's minds  damaged even as his body lives on to  assist future travelers and maybe that's  why the trailer shows godwin's corpse  opening its eyes as black liquid oozes  from beneath its eyelids  one of the biggest changes that eldon  ring will introduce to the souls  sub-genre is an open world that puts a  heavy emphasis on exploration since the  first dark souls game from software has  been crafting wells that seamlessly  interlinked different areas but eldon  ring will offer an open world in the  more traditional sense in november 2021  bandai namco finally released a gameplay  preview of eldon ring that gave players  a taste of the variety of locations they  would encounter throughout the game the  recent data mining leagues have revealed  even more details about what's in store  for adventurers come february 2022 we  happy yeah we happy  one file that's been leaked makes  reference to the other eternal city the  speakers say that the city hides a  cradle chalice and though the importance  of the chalice has yet to be revealed  from software fans will likely remember  the importance of chalices in bloodborne  in that game chalices were used to  generate dungeons that could be explored  for unique loot and bosses some other  elder ring dialogue has been leaked in a  text file and an unknown speaker makes  reference to a secret path that leads  through a well to the meeting place of  the great caravan somewhere under the  capital secret paths and underground  cities are nothing new to veterans or  from software's previous games but we'll  have to wait until february or the next  round of leaks to piece together how the  great caravan fits into the game's story  from software's games tend to have  stories that are rich with details but  difficult to understand they're often  told through item descriptions and  opaque bits of dialogue threaded  throughout the game which turns piecing  things together into a challenging  mini-game of its own that makes this  particular leak especially exciting for  anyone who wants a deeper understanding  of elder ring's main story i  offer you an accord  datamined files from the game's closed  network tests contain an entire quest  worth of dialogue the dialogue comes  from millicent a young girl suffering  from scarlet rot and gauri the sage who  raised her milicent is the daughter of  melania who rules parts of the lands  between with her five sisters melania  once fought the giant lord radhan and  one day she will replace her mother  marika as queen gary asks that players  kill millerson from a lania ascends to  the throne only then will millicent  quote begin to flower and become a  scarlet valkyrie the branching dialogue  seems to reveal that players have the  option to either do as gary asks or to  help millicent escape her fate there's  no indication of how sensual this  particular quest line is to the main  story but fans already know from the  game's official description the queen  marika the eternal and her daughters are  a main focus  if the leaks are to be believed many fan  favorite methods of mowing down enemies  from the souls games will be returning  to eldon ring data mining has revealed  many of the various weapon classes that  the tarnish will have at their disposal  as they wonder about the lands between  slaying monsters many classes from the  great sword to the warhammer are soul  series regulars others like the bow and  crossbow have seen their mechanical ups  and downs over the years there are also  some exciting new additions including  the glintstone staff oh that is so  gnarly another returning combat  enhancement is the ability to infuse  weapons with various magical properties  or elements players can make their  blades ignite into flames poison enemies  or deal extreme physical damage for  anyone building a character with a  darker aim on dealing death blood and  occult infusions will likely work  perfectly though gamers don't yet have a  clear understanding of how they augment  damage there were no major surprises in  the weapons and infusions leak but there  are more than enough new touches to get  fan's imaginations running wild  the bosses of eldon ring will likely  provide some of the game's most  memorable moments  thy flame  let it be market the fell  there'll be no shortage of monstrous  death dealers for players to tackle  during their exploration of the lands  between but another spoiler claims to  reveal the identities of the six main  bosses who will need to be dispatched to  obtain the great runes players will take  on the golden lord godric the moonlord  ranala the bloodlord mogu the gracelord  morgot the chaos lord huralu and the  giant lord radon the last of these  intimidating warriors can be seen in the  game story trailer the elder ring  leagues uncovered a few other small  insights into two of the bosses there  are three nbc's listed as lord ranala's  children meaning that ronald's boss  battle could be one to look out for it  wouldn't be the first time from software  put players toe-to-toe with multiple  bosses in a single fight radar's  strength level is supported by another  audiophile where a female npc describes  his battle and victory with a  consolation of stars either she's  speaking metaphorically or radon is even  bigger than he appeared in the trailer  a massive text file containing huge  chunks of the game's dialogue was  uncovered during the data mining process  there are pages of text to pour over but  none of them label which characters are  speaking which lines even without that  key information however keen readers  have been able to pull out some inferred  story beats from the file's disjointed  lines and luckily for anyone truly  committed to uncovering as much  information as possible another leak can  work as a helpful guide a list of every  npc in the game has been revealed and it  can tell players quite a lot about what  to expect throughout their time in the  lands between queen marika the various  lords and minnesotans all stand out  because their names come up more often  than others in the dialogue that's been  revealed so far characters with names  like the raider and talking corpses are  little more than interesting mysteries  at this point but others might be  familiar to souls fans get ready to say  hello to patches once again oh the  demons haven't got to you have they i'm  in luck the extensive mpc list is also a  reminder of the game's scale there are  over five dozen npcs named and it's hard  to say for sure that everyone has been  included  sometimes a soundtrack can tell a story  of its own music can make or break a  game's tone and the music of elder ring  has high standards to live up to half a  dozen soundtrack files have been leaked  and they give an instant sense of how  the game will feel in one track epic  coral swells create a grandiose but  unrelentingly eerie atmosphere another  track that sounds like it came straight  out of a bloody fight scene uses a  combination of chorus vocals and  rhythmic strings to build the tension  composer yuka kitamura's talents are on  full display in all of the music that  has been leaked so far it's no surprise  that kitamura also worked on the  soundtrack for bloodborne and clearly  the horror elements that inspired the  previous game's sound have been brought  into elden ring until bandai namco  releases more in-game footage or a  playable demo that's open to the public  listening to these tracks is the closest  fans can get to experiencing the game  first hand  you don't really need leaks to tell you  how elden ring ends after exploring  every inch of the lands between and  slaying countless monsters and foes it  will all come down to one last epic boss  battle dark souls had gwyn lord of  cinder while bloodborne had gay men  every souls game has its own memorable  final bus and there's no reason to  expect that elden ring would suddenly  abandon this integral piece of the tried  and true formula well i'm convinced for  all the information pulled from the  game's closed network test data miners  apparently came up empty on the question  of the game's true big bad instead of  giving a definitive answer fans have  surmised that there are several  different possibilities ranging from  queen marika the eternal to melania's  many daughters queen maraca might be the  obvious choice for a final bus since our  offspring rule the various regions of  the lands between but from software  isn't exactly known for making obvious  decisions with their stories for now the  final battle in eldon ring remains a  mystery but the leagues have definitely  given fans a few credible hints  check out one of our newest videos right  here plus even more looper videos about  your favorite stuff are coming soon  subscribe to our youtube channel and hit  the bell so you don't miss a single one  [Music]
 

